window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Hunted by the man who swore to protect her. Desired by the monster she swore to escape.</b></p> <p>For centuries, a dark force has been hiding in the shadows of Aetherian.</p> <p>Plotting. Manipulating. Seizing power.</p> <p>Waiting for the perfect moment to strike...</p> <p>And now, the only one strong enough to stop it... is already caught in its trap.</p> <p><b>Harlowe</b></p> <p><i>The darkness is coming, and it's calling her name...</i></p> <p>I have to run.</p> <p>I have to resist him.</p> <p>I can’t let him twist me into something I was never meant to be.</p> <p>But the line between monster and man is blurring, and my soul can only take so much.</p> <p><i>The one fated to save them, may be the one who brings them to ruin.</i></p> <p>Yet, there's another voice that lingers in my mind.</p> <p>Another touch that haunts my skin.</p> <p>His soulful brown eyes stalk my dreams, and he will either be my strength... or my destruction.</p> <p>Because he's coming for me.</p> <p><b>Silas</b></p> <p>I was a weapon in their war.</p> <p>Then they lied to me. Used me. And tried to take her from me.</p> <p>But I refuse to give her up.</p> <p>She is my obsession, and I will destroy anyone who gets in my way. Including her.</p> <p>Let the hunt begin.</p> <p><b>Dragons. Desire. Deception. In a world ruled by fire and fate, love is the most dangerous weapon of all.</b></p> <p><i>This story contains topics that may be triggering for some listeners. It is intended for mature audiences (18+) only. Discretion is advised.</i></p>"; 
